              "helpUri": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-30861",
              "help": {
                "text": "Remediation: Upgrade flask to version >=2.2.5.",
                "markdown": "### Remediation Guidance\nUpgrade flask to version >=2.2.5.\n\n*References:*\n- https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-30861"
