              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "WSTG Domain: Authentication Testing\nObjective: Test for Default, Weak, and Hardcoded Credentials\nEvidence: 4 hardcoded credential patterns found."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://owasp.org/www-project-web-security-testing-guide/v42/4-Web_Application_Security_Testing/WSTG-ATHN-02",
              "help": {
                "text": "Remediation: Consult OWASP WSTG v4.2 guide for test ID `WSTG-ATHN-02` to implement verified security control.",
                "markdown": "### Remediation Guidance\nConsult OWASP WSTG v4.2 guide for test ID `WSTG-ATHN-02` to implement verified security control.\n\n*References:*\n- https://owasp.org/www-project-web-security-testing-guide/v42/4-Web_Application_Security_Testing/WSTG-ATHN-02"
              },
              "properties": {
